dlg.webview2_body:
NetSense needs the Microsoft Edge WebView2 runtime to display its interface, and this system does not have it.

Install it and start NetSense again — the Evergreen Bootstrapper is enough, and it installs quickly:
  {bootstrapper}

Download page (for other versions or an offline installer):
  {download}

Note: Windows 10 1803 and later, and Windows 11, usually ship with this component. If you are seeing this, the system edition has most likely been stripped down, or security software removed the component.

